OL,3,AStreet Fighter movie is 'made by fans
OL,4,Afor fans' - but can it KO the critics?
OL,5,
OL,6,FVideo game fans have been treated to a
OL,7,Ftwo-hit combo of big screen adaptations
OL,8,Frecently.
OL,10,FFirst came Resident Evil, director Zach
OL,11,FCregger's movie version of the
OL,12,Flong-running horror game series.
OL,14,FThe next contender is Street Fighter,
OL,15,Fthe arcade classic fighting game that's
OL,16,Fbeen separating fans from their loose
OL,17,Fchange since 1987.
OL,19,FBoth have been turned into
OL,20,Fdisappointing live-action films before.
